{"channelId":"UCZuUDQ6iRWcMXNKaQgrRBVg","row":["San Joaquin Valley Rehabilitation Hospital",482,"Medical rehabilitation is a necessity for many patients dealing with serious injury or illness in order to make a maximized recovery. San Joaquin Valley Rehabilitation Hospital offers long-term inpatient and outpatient physical therapy services that traditional medical centers do not have the time or resources to provide their patients. Whether you are staying with us overnight for the foreseeable future or coming in daily for your therapy session, our team will provide you with focused, personalized care that addresses your specific medical needs and goals.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuUDQ6iRWcMXNKaQgrRBVg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuUDQ6iRWcMXNKaQgrRBVg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:15.015Z","channelId":"UCZuUDQ6iRWcMXNKaQgrRBVg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"caa5aae8fc7fed88f47b7885a7e10bd82e31e27944b5c179d80192094fa49492","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"00e8eaac788396b6d634d193e6d59328ef12393fc0b380f5e3546176f6bf3a44"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuUDQ6iRWcMXNKaQgrRBVg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:15.015Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuUDQ6iRWcMXNKaQgrRBVg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":482,"raw":"482 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuUDQ6iRWcMXNKaQgrRBVg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:23:15.015Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["physical therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队